ds an `origin` to all spans, which defaults to `manual` but is\r\nset to something more meaningful for all our auto instrumentation.\r\n\r\nI tried to come up with reasonable origin names, I hope it makes sense\r\neverywhere 😅 Also note that this now uses a new TS feature which seems\r\nto be correctly transpiled to TS 3.8, as far as I can tell! 🎉\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-javascript/issues/8510\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Luca Forstner <luca.forstner@sentry.io>\r\nCo-authored-by: Lukas Stracke <lukas.stracke@sentry.io>","tree":{"sha":"ecc560d36df97ec8b3367f3165b6d2df8344b7d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/trees/ecc560d36df97ec8b3367f3165b6d2df8344b7d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/getsentry/sentry-javascript/git/commits/0fd86bc64e96c52cf5c594d331cd2e286440e74c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJk7fOhCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAh2gIAA6M3M9R/WA2j8oe5FA8Cto0\nGiSR1T/+s0o0+1SWTsZMnQ8HEQQ1BTJVHPlPnVukWC07B7c64KzyhL7unuWo5Uzr\n/lCMQlrNiBtVSQ3/UEcOEDRNs2nr+o5XEaHrY9XfkEw3QgBJoKD2KkvAgIcs/Xqb\nxLDGvRbbBLTdT04gOyuvVJ2PhimYCaryOT7o6rft3vSRRJXXIJpJMb5BPwSKFi4j\nRq5b1kvVQNq1vxlShpBvA/TUyEm+UuUggTdNPbjCxpjmalys/PZHCuqPUo78UYLw\nGhPab9MkPWvd585cFN1S2WeJ1a/kdGqPy0rYZtLb698+rRflSWq0bRD/YuqTqI0=\n=LGbu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree ecc560d36df97ec8b3367f3165b6d2df8344b7d4\nparent e72c04712c2156cb2c614906afbf819d941de9c7\nauthor Francesco Novy <francesco.novy@sentry.io> 1693316001 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1693316001 +0200\n\nref(tracing): Add `origin` to spans (#8765)\n\nThis adds an `origin` to all spans, which defaults to `manual` but is\r\nset to something more meaningful for all our auto instrumentation.\r\n\r\nI tried to come up with reasonable origin names, I hope it makes sense\r\neverywhere 😅 Also note that this now uses a new TS feature which seems\r\nto be correctly transpil